            "description": "Nennd  a    d se daens (1, 2, 5, 7\u201310, 12, 13 and 15) with Tangier disease. One patient (13) had severe mental retardation and spasticity which were attributed to cerebral trauma at the time of birth. Neurologic manifestations in the other 9 patients have been those of peripheral neuropathy"
